#   gi.RepositoryError: Requiring namespace 'Gdk' version '3.0',
#                       but '4.0' is already loaded
# kodachi_ui pins Gdk itself, but it is imported BELOW this line, which is too
# late. Caught by running the window on a test VM; no source-level check would
# have found it, because the file is valid Python either way.
